cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BioManager in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: BioManager
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source lab management app for a biology lab's animal colonies
  (mice, zebrafish, flies, worms and any other organism), plasmids, samples,
  orders, reagents, antibodies and viruses, with a calendar and a lab notebook.
  It runs as a desktop app for one person or as a server for a whole lab.
authors:
  - name: gaspolymerase
repository-code: "https://github.com/gaspolymerase/biomanager"
url: "https://biomanager.org"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - lab management
  - mouse colony management
  - animal colony
  - laboratory information management system
  - electronic lab notebook
  - plasmids
  - inventory
  - zebrafish
  - drosophila
